/T (I've been surrounded by video games for as long as I can remember. My grandmother owned a video and game rental shop, and some of my favorite memories are family nights playing Super Mario World or getting so caught up in Crash Bandicoot with my mom that I was late for school several times.)
/E (I've been surrounded by video games for as long as I can remember. My grandmother owned a video and game rental shop, and some of my favorite memories are family nights playing Super Mario World or getting so caught up in Crash Bandicoot with my mom that I was late for school several times.)
